<h2 id="plan-your-visit">Plan Your Visit</h2>
<p>Plan to arrive a few minutes early to find a seat. All are welcome here at The Table, and we hope you feel comfortable joining us.</p>
<p><a href="/service-times-locations/">Find the service time, address, parking information, and directions</a>.</p>
<h2 id="whats-next">What’s Next? Join In</h2>
<p>When you are ready to connect beyond a Sunday service, the <strong>Join In</strong> menu is the place to start. You can find <a href="/meetups/">MeetUps</a>, <a href="/kids-youth/">Kids &amp; Youth</a>, <a href="/community-meal/">Community Meals</a>, and other <a href="/get-involved/">ways to get involved</a>.</p>
<p>You can also learn more about the church and how to join our community through the <a href="/welcome-to-the-table-class/">Welcome to the Table Class</a>.</p>
<h2 id="want-someone-to-contact-you">Want Someone to Contact You?</h2>
<p>If you would like someone to contact you, <a href="/contact-us/">please send us a message</a> and we will be in touch.</p>
